      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PostgreSQL 19 给 autovacuum 加了打分与并行",
      "summary": "Shaun Thomas 梳理 PostgreSQL 19 的 autovacuum 变化：表按事务号年龄、multixact 年龄、死元组、插入元组和统计变化五项打分，取最高项决定优先级，五个权重参数默认都是 1.0；另加 autovacuum_max_parallel_workers，让单个 worker 并行处理索引。新视图 pg_stat_autovacuum_scores 暴露每张表的得分。他建议多数集群先保持默认权重。",
      "url": "https://www.pgedge.com/blog/looking-forward-to-postgres-19-autovacuum-tweaks",
      "author": "Shaun Thomas",
      "source": "pgEdge 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-07-24",
